<title>USA: Delta Express adds more flights to Fla..</title>
<headline>Delta Express adds more flights to Fla..</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc's Delta Express said on Tuesday it would begin three new daily, nonstop flights on Wednesday between Tampa, Fla. and Boston, Mass., and add another flight from Boston to Orlando, Fla.</p>
<p>The new low-fare flights are the result of the launch of Delta Air Lines' new low-fare intiative, which is being operated as a businesss unit within Delta, it said.</p>
<p>Delta Express operates a fleet of 25 Boeing 737-200 aircraft.</p>
